{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling-statistical-inference","title":"抽样与统计推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/research-methods-open-science/measurement-data/sampling-statistical-inference","wordCount":1436,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"抽样与统计推断\">抽样与统计推断</h1><p>你研究了 80 个大学生，却想说一句关于「人类」的话。这一跃——从手里这群人跳到从未谋面的总体——是统计推断的全部冒险，也是它一切威力与风险的来源。这一篇讲清楚这一跃如何完成、靠什么支撑，以及主导心理学半个世纪的零假设显著性检验（NHST）为何既是利器又是众矢之的。它承接 <a href=\"measurement-reliability-validity\">测量、信度与效度</a> 拿到的分数，要把它们变成关于总体的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>统计推断的逻辑骨架是：总体太大无法穷尽，于是抽一个样本，用样本统计量去估计总体参数，并诚实地标出这种估计的不确定性。整个过程能否成立，第一道关卡是抽样是否让样本代表总体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[总体&lt;br/&gt;想说话的对象] --&gt;|抽样| S[样本&lt;br/&gt;实际研究的人]&#10;  S --&gt; ST[计算样本统计量&lt;br/&gt;均值/相关]&#10;  ST --&gt;|推断| EST[估计总体参数&lt;br/&gt;带不确定性]&#10;  EST --&gt; P&#10;  S -.偏差.-&gt; B[抽样偏差&lt;br/&gt;样本不代表总体]\">flowchart TD\n  P[总体&lt;br/&gt;想说话的对象] --&gt;|抽样| S[样本&lt;br/&gt;实际研究的人]\n  S --&gt; ST[计算样本统计量&lt;br/&gt;均值/相关]\n  ST --&gt;|推断| EST[估计总体参数&lt;br/&gt;带不确定性]\n  EST --&gt; P\n  S -.偏差.-&gt; B[抽样偏差&lt;br/&gt;样本不代表总体]</pre><p>下表区分两大类抽样方法。概率抽样让每个个体有已知的入样概率，是推断合法性的前提；非概率抽样方便但代表性存疑，而心理学里铺天盖地的恰恰是后者。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抽样方法</th>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单随机抽样</td>\n<td>概率</td>\n<td>每人等概率入样，推断的黄金标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层抽样</td>\n<td>概率</td>\n<td>按子群分层再抽，提高代表性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整群抽样</td>\n<td>概率</td>\n<td>抽整个群体单位，省成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>便利抽样</td>\n<td>非概率</td>\n<td>抽手边好找的人，偏差大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚雪球抽样</td>\n<td>非概率</td>\n<td>由被试推荐被试，适合隐蔽人群</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"weird-样本问题\">WEIRD 样本问题</h2><p>心理学有一个长期被掩盖的代表性丑闻：绝大多数研究的被试是 WEIRD 的——来自西方（Western）、受教育（Educated）、工业化（Industrialized）、富裕（Rich）、民主（Democratic）社会，且很多是为修学分而参与的大学生。Henrich 等人指出，这群人在视错觉、公平观、道德判断等许多方面恰恰是全人类中的异类，却被默认成「人类」的代表。</p>\n<p>这是一个外部效度问题，与 <a href=\"../research-design/intro-and-core-concepts\">心理学研究方法导论</a> 中的效度框架直接对接：再大的样本，若系统性地只来自一类人，统计推断的合法范围也只到这类人为止。WEIRD 问题在 <a href=\"../replication-open-science/replication-crisis\">复制危机</a> 中被反复提及，因为许多无法跨文化复制的「人类普遍规律」，本质上只是关于 WEIRD 群体的局部规律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽样分布与中心极限定理\">抽样分布与中心极限定理</h2><p>统计推断之所以可能，靠的是一个近乎奇迹的数学事实：中心极限定理。它说，无论总体本身分布多古怪，只要样本量足够大，样本均值的抽样分布都近似正态，且其标准差（称为标准误）随样本量增大而缩小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0376em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3097em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>标准误是统计推断的核心量——它衡量「如果反复抽样，样本均值会上下抖动多大」。注意分母是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2397em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>：要把不确定性减半，样本量得翻到四倍，这条「平方根惩罚」解释了为什么追求精度的代价是昂贵的。</p>\n<p>置信区间正是建立在标准误之上：95% 置信区间约为样本均值加减两倍标准误。它的正确解读常被误解——95% 指的是「这套构造区间的程序在反复使用中有 95% 的次数会罩住真参数」，而不是「真参数有 95% 概率落在这个具体区间里」。这种频率派解释的别扭，正是 <a href=\"../replication-open-science/bayesian-bigdata-ai-frontiers\">贝叶斯、大数据与AI前沿</a> 中可信区间试图改善的痛点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nhst-的逻辑与它的原罪\">NHST 的逻辑与它的原罪</h2><p>零假设显著性检验是心理学论文里最常见的仪式，它的逻辑是一种反证法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  H[设零假设H0:无效应] --&gt; D[收集数据]&#10;  D --&gt; C[计算检验统计量]&#10;  C --&gt; P[算p值:&lt;br/&gt;若H0为真,出现&lt;br/&gt;如此或更极端数据的概率]&#10;  P --&gt; J{p &lt; 0.05?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| R[拒绝H0&lt;br/&gt;结果显著]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| NR[不拒绝H0&lt;br/&gt;证据不足]\">graph TD\n  H[设零假设H0:无效应] --&gt; D[收集数据]\n  D --&gt; C[计算检验统计量]\n  C --&gt; P[算p值:&lt;br/&gt;若H0为真,出现&lt;br/&gt;如此或更极端数据的概率]\n  P --&gt; J{p &lt; 0.05?}\n  J --&gt;|是| R[拒绝H0&lt;br/&gt;结果显著]\n  J --&gt;|否| NR[不拒绝H0&lt;br/&gt;证据不足]</pre><p>p 值的精确定义是：假定零假设为真，观测到当前或更极端结果的概率。注意它<strong>不是</strong>「零假设为真的概率」，也<strong>不是</strong>「结果由偶然造成的概率」——这两个是流传最广的误读。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &lt; 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 这条线由 Fisher 随手定下，本无神圣性，却被制度化成发表的生死线，由此催生了无穷的麻烦。</p>\n<p>NHST 的原罪有三。其一，它把连续的证据强度硬切成「显著/不显著」的二分，丢失大量信息。其二，p 值高度依赖样本量：样本足够大时，任何微不足道的差异都会「显著」，反之真实效应在小样本里会被判「不显著」。其三，也是最致命的，对单个 p 值的痴迷只字不提效应有多大、检验有多大把握——而这恰恰是 <a href=\"effect-size-power-meta\">效应量、功效与元分析</a> 要补上的。把发表系于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &lt; 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 这一条线，直接孕育了 p-hacking 这一在 <a href=\"../replication-open-science/replication-crisis\">复制危机</a> 中被详细解剖的可疑实践。2016 年美国统计学会罕见地就 p 值发表官方声明，警告不可把统计显著等同于科学重要或效应为真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>统计推断的核心是从样本跃向总体，第一道关卡是抽样代表性：概率抽样是合法推断的前提，便利抽样偏差大。</li>\n<li>心理学样本长期 WEIRD 化，把一类异常人群冒充全人类，是一个严重且被低估的外部效度问题。</li>\n<li>中心极限定理让样本均值近似正态，标准误 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE = \\sigma/\\sqrt{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不确定性的度量，精度提升受平方根惩罚。</li>\n<li>p 值是「假定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真时出现当前或更极端数据的概率」，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真的概率，这是最常见的误读。</li>\n<li>NHST 的二分化、对样本量敏感、以及对效应量与功效的沉默，是它招致批评并埋下 p-hacking 隐患的根源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"抽样与统计推断","id":"抽样与统计推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WEIRD 样本问题","id":"weird-样本问题"},{"level":2,"text":"抽样分布与中心极限定理","id":"抽样分布与中心极限定理"},{"level":2,"text":"NHST 的逻辑与它的原罪","id":"nhst-的逻辑与它的原罪"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"测量、信度与效度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/research-methods-open-science/measurement-data/measurement-reliability-validity"},"next":{"title":"效应量、功效与元分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/research-methods-open-science/measurement-data/effect-size-power-meta"}}